<title>POLAND: Agros Q2 net falls to PLN 4.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Agros Q2 net falls to PLN 4.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agros preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     3.67   vs    7.45</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 7.40   vs   14.58</p>
<p>    net profit			     4.53   vs    9.94</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Agros Holding SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     28.46   vs   20.33</p>
<p>    costs of sales			25.67   vs   18.40</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.01   vs    0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.86   vs    4.64</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   7.92   vs    7.87</p>
<p>    financial costs			4.20   vs    0.73</p>
<p>    investment			     9.08   vs   11.79</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     6.73   vs   12.08</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			11.33   vs   21.42</p>
<p>    net profit			     7.34   vs   15.25</p>
<p>    net sales			     56.32   vs   54.41</p>
<p>    costs of sales			49.29   vs   44.89</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     3.99   vs    6.17</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   9.29   vs   14.87</p>
<p>    financial costs			4.70   vs    5.55</p>
<p>    investment			    29.04   vs   39.33</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
